OL,3,AReform UK promises #80bn cuts to public
OL,4,Aspending
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform would be the "party of fiscal
OL,7,Fresponsibility", he said and promised
OL,8,Fto make "big changes... in a careful
OL,9,Fway, not a cack-handed way".
OL,11,FLabour said the proposed cuts were
OL,12,F"incredibly reckless and could mean
OL,13,Fvital public services like hospitals,
OL,14,Fschools and law enforcement are put at
OL,15,Frisk".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
