OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Aremove juror from murder trial after
OL,5,Atense exchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge tells the jury to keep
OL,8,Fdeliberating for a third time in the
OL,9,Ftrial of Lindsay Clancy, who is accused
OL,10,Fof killing her three small children in
OL,11,FMassachusetts in 2023
OL,13,FClancy's lawyer Kevin Reddington has
OL,14,Fasked the judge to remove one juror who
OL,15,Fhe says isn't following the rules
OL,17,FClancy is charged with three counts of
OL,18,Ffirst-degree murder, as the prosecution
OL,19,Fargues she made a calculated,
OL,20,Fintentional decision to kill them
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
