OL,3,AUN warns of 'supersized' El Nino as
OL,4,Acountries prepare for impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FForecasters also say El Nino will boost
OL,7,Ftemperatures in some places, coming on
OL,8,Ftop of rising heat globally from
OL,9,Fhuman-induced climate change.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
