OL,3,AToxic wildfire haze spreads across
OL,4,ASouth East Asia as 'super' El Nino
OL,5,Aintensifies
OL,6,
OL,7,FA blanket of toxic haze is enveloping
OL,8,Fparts of Indonesia and spreading into
OL,9,FMalaysia, Singapore and the
OL,10,FPhilippines, as weeks-long wildfires
OL,11,Fcontinue to burn.
OL,13,FMillions of people across large swathes
OL,14,Fof South East Asia have been exposed to
OL,15,Fthe smog, which in some areas has
OL,16,Ffuelled "acutely unhealthy" pollution
OL,17,Fmore than 15 times the World Health
OL,18,FOrganization's recommended level.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
