CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788465339
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AToxic wildfire haze spreads across
OL,4,ASouth East Asia as 'super' El Nino
OL,5,Aintensifies
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany of the ongoing fires have been
OL,8,Fburning across Sumatra and Indonesian
OL,9,FBorneo since mid-July ` underpinned by
OL,10,Fa so-called Super El Nino that is
OL,11,Fexacerbating drought conditions.
OL,13,FBetween July and August, Indonesia's
OL,14,FHealth Ministry recorded over 50,000
OL,15,Fcases of respiratory infections linked
OL,16,Fto land and forest fires.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
